### Reservation Management Tests
### Make sure to authenticate first using the auth endpoints to get access tokens
### Replace {{accessToken}} with a valid JWT access token from authentication
### Also make sure you have created vehicles and parking slots before testing reservations

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@contentType = application/json

@accessToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOjEsImVtYWlsIjoidGVzdEBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsInJvbGUiOiJjdXN0b21lciIsImlhdCI6MTc2MDEyNjk4NSwiZXhwIjoxNzYwMTMwNTg1fQ.t4d8SVONI2cR4MBqAwK4QNh7xDkGgjhYnfHVuEpO3Ck

### 1. Create a New Reservation
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "slotId": 1,
  "startTime": "2024-01-15T10:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2024-01-15T12:00:00Z",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "entryTime": "2024-01-15T10:05:00Z",
  "totalAmount": 15.50,
  "paymentStatus": "PENDING"
}

### 2. Create Another Reservation (Different Time Slot)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "vehicleId": 2,
  "slotId": 2,
  "startTime": "2024-01-15T14:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2024-01-15T16:00:00Z",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "entryTime": "2024-01-15T14:05:00Z",
  "totalAmount": 20.00,
  "paymentStatus": "PENDING"
}

### 3. Create Reservation with Minimal Data
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "slotId": 3,
  "startTime": "2024-01-16T09:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2024-01-16T11:00:00Z",
  "entryTime": "2024-01-16T09:05:00Z"
}

### 4. Get All Reservations (with pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Get Reservations by Vehicle ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?vehicleId=1&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Get Reservations by Parking Slot ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?slotId=1&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Get Active Reservations Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?status=ACTIVE&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Get Completed Reservations Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?status=COMPLETED&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. Get Cancelled Reservations Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?status=CANCELLED&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Get Pending Payment Reservations
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?paymentStatus=PENDING&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 11. Get Paid Reservations
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?paymentStatus=PAID&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 12. Get Failed Payment Reservations
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?paymentStatus=FAILED&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 13. Get Reservations by Date Range (Start Date)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?startDateFrom=2024-01-15T00:00:00Z&startDateTo=2024-01-15T23:59:59Z&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 14. Get Reservations by Date Range (End Date)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?endDateFrom=2024-01-15T00:00:00Z&endDateTo=2024-01-15T23:59:59Z&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 15. Get Active Reservations (All)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/active
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 16. Get Reservation Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 17. Get Reservations by Vehicle ID (Direct)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/vehicle/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 18. Get Vehicle Reservation History
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/vehicle/1/history
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 19. Get Reservations by Slot ID (Direct)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/slot/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 20. Get Slot Reservation History
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/slot/1/history
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 21. Get Reservation by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 22. Update Reservation Information
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "endTime": "2024-01-15T13:00:00Z",
  "totalAmount": 18.75
}

### 23. Checkout Reservation (Complete with Payment)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/1/checkout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "exitTime": "2024-01-15T12:55:00Z",
  "totalAmount": 15.50,
  "paymentStatus": "PAID"
}

### 24. Cancel Reservation
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/2/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 25. Delete Reservation
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reservations/3
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

