### 33. Test Slot Conflict (Same Slot, Overlapping Time)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "vehicleId": 2,
  "slotId": 1,
  "startTime": "2024-01-15T11:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2024-01-15T13:00:00Z",
  "entryTime": "2024-01-15T11:05:00Z"
}

### 34. Test Checkout Non-Active Reservation
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/2/checkout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "exitTime": "2024-01-15T15:55:00Z",
  "totalAmount": 20.00,
  "paymentStatus": "PAID"
}

