### 41. Test Large Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?page=1&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 42. Test Negative Page Number
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?page=-1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 43. Test Zero Limit
