Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 44. Test Multiple Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?vehicleId=1&status=ACTIVE&paymentStatus=PENDING&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 45. Test Complex Date Filtering
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?startDateFrom=2024-01-15T00:00:00Z&endDateTo=2024-01-15T23:59:59Z&status=ACTIVE&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

