### 50. Test Complete Workflow
### Step 1: Create Reservation
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "slotId": 1,
  "startTime": "2024-01-17T10:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2024-01-17T12:00:00Z",
  "entryTime": "2024-01-17T10:05:00Z"
}

### Step 2: Check Reservation Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/active
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Step 3: Update Reservation
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/4
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "totalAmount": 12.50
}

### Step 4: Checkout Reservation
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/4/checkout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "exitTime": "2024-01-17T11:55:00Z",
  "totalAmount": 12.50,
  "paymentStatus": "PAID"
}

### Step 5: Verify Completion
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/4
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
